    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0109",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s05-p155-01140-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In Chapter 7, I talked about how Michael Phelps and Simone Biles, arguably the best swimmer and gymnast of all time, suffered from depression and lost interest in the sports they excelled at.",
